# WS3 scale moment (Class 2): built taxi databases, too large for git and
# fully reproducible from demos/clase-02/scale/build_sqlite.sh against the
# downloaded TLC parquet files in the local data/ directory. Keep the
# .sql/.sh scripts tracked; only the generated databases are ignored.
demos/clase-02/scale/taxi.sqlite
demos/clase-02/scale/*.duckdb

# WS4 pipeline (Class 2): D1 extracts and fallback CSVs, regenerated on every
# demos/clase-02/pipeline/run_all.sh run. Keep the scripts tracked.
demos/clase-02/pipeline/out/
# Taxi parquet files: downloaded by demos/clase-02/scale/download-data.py.
# The folder itself stays in git through .gitkeep and README.md.
demos/clase-02/scale/data/*.parquet
demos/clase-02/scale/data/*.part

# Local Class 2 planning notes; public teaching material lives under demos/.
CLASS2-PLAN.md
SUMMARY.md

